{"title":"Rime Shard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Rime Elemental that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>166</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>209</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rime-shard?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>166</td><td>in the wilds around 91, -1086</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>209</td><td>in the wilds around 30, -1093</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rime-shard\" data-map-level=\"62\">Show level 62 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rime-crystal\" title=\"Rime Crystal - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/582c41ee5ac2654c6a77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rime Crystal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Lost Seam</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 14</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-484\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-755.1px,365.5px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:746.6px;top:-367.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:730.9px;top:-372.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:810.2px;top:-347.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:801.0px;top:-339.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:851.8px;top:-398.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:737.8px;top:-382.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:733.8px;top:-368.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:767.9px;top:-357.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:835.3px;top:-351.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:839.6px;top:-345.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:712.3px;top:-371.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:753.5px;top:-375.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:781.7px;top:-374.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:800.8px;top:-351